@page "/overlay"

<PageTitle>Overlay</PageTitle>

<h1>Overlay</h1>

<p>
    The WotB Treader overlay is a companion WPF application that discovers this
    web host via its local rendezvous record. It lists battle sessions, plots
    position samples on a canvas, and embeds this dashboard in a WebView2 tab.
</p>

<h2>Features</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Session list with map name, time, participant count, and position samples</li>
    <li>Team-colored position scatter plot with auto-refresh every 2 seconds</li>
    <li>Embedded dashboard (this page) for session diagnostics and details</li>
    <li>SignalR push-based session list updates (2-second timer as fallback)</li>
</ul>

<h2>Launching</h2>
<p>
    Start the web host first, then launch <code>WotBTreader.Overlay.exe</code>.
    The overlay automatically discovers the host and begins listing sessions.
</p>

<p>
    If the overlay shows <em>Waiting for host…</em>, ensure the web host is
    running and the rendezvous record has not expired.
</p>
